msgstr "<strong>“rekoto” le “lifaele” pokello.</strong> Ka tloaelo, ho bonolo ho lokolla “rekoto” le “lifaele” e le likoleke tse fapaneng, e le hore li ka lokolloa ka linako tse fapaneng, mohlala, ho ipapisitsoe le litefiso tsa ho kuta. “Rekoto” ke pokello e nang le metadata feela, e nang le tlhahisoleseling e kang litlotla tsa libuka, bangoli, ISBNs, joalo-joalo, ha “lifaele” e le likoleke tse nang le lifaele tsa 'nete ka botsona (pdf, epub)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid"
msgstr "<strong>AACID.</strong> Sebopeho sa AACID ke sena: <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__{collection}__{ISO 8601 timestamp}__{collection-specific ID}__{shortuuid}</code>. Mohlala, AACID ea 'nete eo re e lokollotseng ke <code style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z__22433983__URsJNGy5CjokTsNT6hUmmj</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection"
msgstr "<code>{collection}</code>: lebitso la pokello, le ka 'nang la ba le litlhaku tsa ASCII, linomoro, le likhutsufatso (empa ha ho likhutsufatso tse peli tse latellanang)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.iso8601"
msgstr "<code>{ISO 8601 timestamp}</code>: mofuta o mokhuts'oane oa ISO 8601, kamehla o le UTC, mohlala <code>20220723T194746Z</code>. Nomoro ena e tlameha ho eketseha ka tatellano bakeng sa tokollo e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe, leha moelelo oa eona o ka fapana ho latela pokello. Re khothaletsa ho sebelisa nako ea ho kuta kapa ea ho hlahisa ID."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.collection-id"
msgstr "<code>{collection-specific ID}</code>: sesupo se ikhethileng sa pokello, haeba se sebetsa, mohlala, ID ea Z-Library. E ka 'na ea hlakoloa kapa ea khutsufatsoa. E tlameha ho hlakoloa kapa ho khutsufatsoa haeba AACID e ka feta litlhaku tse 150."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid.shortuuid"
msgstr "<code>{shortuuid}</code>: UUID empa e hatelitsoe ho ASCII, mohlala, ho sebelisa base57. Hajoale re sebelisa laeborari ea <a %(github_skorokithakis_shortuuid)s>shortuuid</a> ea Python."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.aacid-range"
msgstr "<strong>Mefuta ea AACID.</strong> Kaha AACID e na le linako tse eketsehang ka tatellano, re ka sebelisa seo ho bontša mefuta e itseng ka har'a pokello e itseng. Re sebelisa sebopeho sena: <code style=\"color: blue\">aacid__{collection}__{from_timestamp}--{to_timestamp}</code>, moo linako li kenyeletsang. Sena se lumellana le notate ea ISO 8601. Mefuta e tsoelang pele, 'me e ka kopana, empa haeba e kopana e tlameha ho ba le lirekoto tse tšoanang le tse lokollotsoeng pejana pokellong eo (kaha AACs ha li fetoheng). Lirekoto tse sieo ha li lumelloe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file"
msgstr "<strong>Faele ea metadata.</strong> Faele ea metadata e na le metadata ea mefuta e mengata ea AACs, bakeng sa pokello e le 'ngoe. Li na le litšobotsi tse latelang:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.filename"
msgstr "Lebitso la faele le tlameha ho ba mefuta ea AACID, e qalang ka <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> 'me e lateloa ke <code>.jsonl.zstd</code>. Mohlala, e 'ngoe ea likhatiso tsa rona e bitsoa<br><code><span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_records__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z</span>.jsonl.zst</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.jsonlines"
msgstr "Joalokaha ho bontšitsoe ke katoloso ea faele, mofuta oa faele ke <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> e hatelitsoeng ka <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.fields"
msgstr "Ntho e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe ea JSON e tlameha ho ba le masimo a latelang boemong bo ka holimo: <strong>aacid</strong>, <strong>metadata</strong>, <strong>data_folder</strong> (ka boikhethelo). Ha ho masimo a mang a lumelletsoeng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.metadata"
msgstr "<code>metadata</code> ke metadata e sa reroang, ho latela moelelo oa pokello. E tlameha ho lumellana ka moelelo ka har'a pokello."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.data_folder"
msgstr "<code>data_folder</code> ke boikhethelo, 'me ke lebitso la foldara ea data ea binary e nang le data ea binary e tsamaellanang. Lebitso la faele la data ea binary e tsamaellanang ka har'a foldara eo ke AACID ea rekoto."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.metadata-file.prefix"
msgstr "Selekane sa <code style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</code> se ka fetoloa ho lebitso la setheo sa hau, mohlala <code style=\"color: red\">my_institute_meta__</code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary"
msgstr "<strong>Foldara ea data ea binary.</strong> Foldara e nang le data ea binary ea mefuta e mengata ea AACs, bakeng sa pokello e le 'ngoe. Li na le litšobotsi tse latelang:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.name"
msgstr "Lebitso la directory le tlameha ho ba mefuta ea AACID, e qalang ka <code style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</code>, 'me ha ho sephutheloana. Mohlala, e 'ngoe ea likhatiso tsa rona e na le directory e bitsoang<br><code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__zlib3_files__20230808T055130Z--20230808T055131Z</span></code>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.contents"
msgstr "Directory e tlameha ho ba le lifaele tsa data bakeng sa AACs tsohle ka har'a mefuta e boletsoeng. Faele e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe ea data e tlameha ho ba le AACID ea eona e le lebitso la faele (ha ho katoloso)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.binary.tip"
msgstr "Ho eletsoa ho etsa hore lifoldara tsena li be bonolo ho laola ka boholo, mohlala, li se ke tsa feta 100GB-1TB ka 'ngoe, leha tlhahiso ena e ka fetoha ha nako e ntse e ea."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.standard.torrents"
msgstr "<strong>Torrents.</strong> Lifoldara tsa metadata le data ea binary li ka kopanngoa ka har'a li-torrents, ka torrent e le 'ngoe ka faele ea metadata, kapa torrent e le 'ngoe ka foldara ea data ea binary. Li-torrents li tlameha ho ba le lebitso la faele/directory ea pele hammoho le <code>.torrent</code> e le lebitso la faele ea tsona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.heading"
msgstr "Mohlala"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text1"
msgstr "A re shebeng tokollo ea rona ea morao-rao ea Z-Library e le mohlala. E na le likoleke tse peli: “<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>” le “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”. Sena se re lumella ho ntša le ho lokolla lirekoto tsa metadata ka thoko ho lifaele tsa libuka tsa 'nete. Ka hona, re ile ra lokolla li-torrents tse peli tse nang le lifaele tsa metadata:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text2"
msgstr "Re boetse re lokolotse sehlopha sa li-torrents tse nang le lifoldara tsa data ea binary, empa feela bakeng sa pokello ea “<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>”, kaofela li le 62:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text3"
msgstr "Ka ho tsamaisa <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #fffaa3\">zlib3_records</span>__20230808T014342Z--20230808T023702Z.jsonl.zst</span></code> re ka bona se ka hare:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text4"
msgstr "Tabeng ena, ke metadata ea buka e tlalehiloeng ke Z-Library. Boemong bo ka holimo re na le feela “aacid” le “metadata”, empa ha ho na “data_folder”, kaha ha ho na data ea binary e tsamaellanang. AACID e na le “22430000” e le ID e ka sehloohong, eo re ka bonang e nkiloeng ho “zlibrary_id”. Re ka lebella AAC e meng pokellong ena ho ba le sebopeho se tšoanang."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text5"
msgstr "Joale a re tsamaiseng <code>zstdcat <span style=\"color: red\">annas_archive_meta__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230809T223215Z.jsonl.zst</span></code>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text6"
msgstr "Sena ke metadata e nyane haholo ea AAC, leha ho le joalo boholo ba AAC ena bo fumaneha kae-kae ka faeleng ea binary! Qetellong, re na le “data_folder” lekhetlong lena, kahoo re ka lebella hore data ea binary e tsamaellanang e fumanehe ho <code><span style=\"color: green\">annas_archive_data__</span><span style=\"color: blue\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z--20230808T051504Z</span>/<span style=\"color: #0093ff\">aacid__<span style=\"background: #ffd6fe\">zlib3_files</span>__20230808T051503Z__22433983__NRgUGwTJYJpkQjTbz2jA3M</span></code>. “Metadata” e na le “zlibrary_id”, kahoo re ka e hokahanya habonolo le AAC e tsamaellanang pokellong ea “zlib_records”. Re ka be re e hokahantse ka mekhoa e fapaneng, mohlala, ka AACID — maemo ha a laele seo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.example.text7"
msgstr "Hlokomela hore ha ho hlokahale hore tšimo ea “metadata” e be JSON ka boeona. E ka ba mola o nang le XML kapa sebopeho se seng sa data. U ka ba ua boloka tlhahisoleseling ea metadata ka har'a blob ea binary e amanang, mohlala, haeba e le data e ngata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.heading"
msgstr "Qetello"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text1"
msgstr "Ka maemo ana, re ka etsa litokollo ka mokhoa o eketsehileng, 'me re eketsa mehloli e mecha ea data habonolo. Re se re ntse re na le litokollo tse 'maloa tse thabisang tse ntseng li etsoa!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion.text2"
msgstr "Re boetse re ts'epa hore ho tla ba bonolo hore lilaeborari tse ling tse lefifi li etsise likoleke tsa rona. Qetellong, sepheo sa rona ke ho boloka tsebo le setso sa batho ka ho sa feleng, kahoo ho feta ho pheta-pheta ho molemo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-archive-containers.conclusion"
msgstr "- Anna le sehlopha (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.title"
msgstr "Tsebiso ea Anna: laeborari e bulehileng ka botlalo, ElasticSearch, 300GB+ ea litšoantšo tsa libuka"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.tldr"
msgstr "Re ntse re sebetsa ka thata ho fana ka mokhoa o mong o motle ka Anna’s Archive. Mona ke tse ling tsa lintho tseo re li fihletseng haufinyane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.text1"
msgstr "Ka Z-Library e theoha le bathehi ba eona (ba belaelloang) ba tšoaroa, re ntse re sebetsa ka thata ho fana ka mokhoa o mong o motle ka Anna’s Archive (re ke ke ra e hokahanya mona, empa u ka e batla ho Google). Mona ke tse ling tsa lintho tseo re li fihletseng haufinyane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source"
msgstr "Anna’s Archive e bulehile ka botlalo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text1"
msgstr "Re lumela hore tlhahisoleseling e lokela ho ba mahala, 'me khoutu ea rona ha e fapane. Re lokolotse khoutu ea rona kaofela ho Gitlab ea rona e amohetsoeng ka lekunutu: <a %(annas_archive)s>Anna’s Software</a>. Re boetse re sebelisa tracker ea litaba ho hlophisa mosebetsi oa rona. Haeba u batla ho kenella nts'etsopele ea rona, ena ke sebaka se setle sa ho qala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text2"
msgstr "Ho u fa tatso ea lintho tseo re li sebetsang, nka mosebetsi oa rona oa morao-rao oa ntlafatso ea ts'ebetso ea lehlakore la moreki. Kaha ha re so sebelise pagination, re ne re tla khutlisa maqephe a malelele a lipatlisiso, ka liphetho tse 100-200. Re ne re sa batle ho khaola liphetho tsa lipatlisiso kapele haholo, empa sena se ne se bolela hore se tla liehisa lisebelisoa tse ling. Bakeng sa sena, re ile ra kenya tšebetsong leqheka le lenyenyane: re ile ra phuthela boholo ba liphetho tsa lipatlisiso ka litlhaloso tsa HTML (<code><!-- --></code>), ebe re ngola Javascript e nyane e neng e tla lemoha ha sephetho se lokela ho bonahala, ka nako eo re ne re tla phutholla tlhaloso:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text3"
msgstr "DOM \"virtualization\" e sebelisitsoe ka mela e 23, ha ho hlokahale lilaebrari tse majabajaba! Ena ke mofuta oa khoutu e potlakileng e sebetsang eo u qetellang u e-na le eona ha u na nako e ngata, le mathata a sebele a hlokang ho rarolloa. Ho tlalehiloe hore patlo ea rona joale e sebetsa hantle ho lisebelisoa tse liehang!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text4"
msgstr "Boiteko bo bong bo boholo e ne e le ho iketsetsa ho aha database. Ha re qala, re ne re kopanya mehloli e fapaneng ka mokhoa o sa hlophisehang. Joale re batla ho e boloka e ntlafalitsoe, kahoo re ngotse mananeo a mangata ho jarolla metadata e mecha ho tsoa ho makala a mabeli a Library Genesis, le ho e kopanya. Sepheo ke ho etsa hore sena se be molemo bakeng sa polokelo ea rona, empa hape ho nolofalletsa mang kapa mang ea batlang ho bapala ka metadata ea laeborari ea moriti. Sepheo e tla ba buka ea Jupyter e nang le mefuta eohle ea metadata e khahlisang e fumanehang, e le hore re ka etsa lipatlisiso tse ling tse kang ho fumana hore na <a %(blog)s>peresente ea ISBNs e bolokiloe ka ho sa feleng</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.open-source.text5"
msgstr "Qetellong, re nchafalitse tsamaiso ea rona ea menehelo. Joale u ka sebelisa karete ea mokitlane ho kenya chelete ka kotloloho mekotleng ea rona ea crypto, ntle le ho hloka ho tseba letho ka li-cryptocurrencies. Re tla tsoelapele ho lekola hore na sena se sebetsa hantle hakae, empa sena ke taba e kholo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es"
msgstr "Fetela ho ElasticSearch"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text1"
msgstr "E 'ngoe ea <a %(annas_archive)s>litekete</a> tsa rona e ne e le pokello ea mathata a tsamaiso ea rona ea patlo. Re ne re sebelisa MySQL full-text search, kaha re ne re e-na le data eohle ea rona ho MySQL leha ho le joalo. Empa e ne e na le meeli ea eona:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem1"
msgstr "Lipotso tse ling li ne li nka nako e telele haholo, ho isa tekanyong ea hore li ne li tla ja likhokahano tsohle tse bulehileng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem2"
msgstr "Ka boiketsetso MySQL e na le bolelele bo fokolang ba lentsoe, kapa index ea hau e ka ba kholo haholo. Batho ba tlalehile hore ha ba khone ho batla \"Ben Hur\"."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem3"
msgstr "Patlo e ne e potlakile hanyane feela ha e kentsoe ka botlalo mohopolong, e neng e hloka hore re fumane mochini o turang ho tsamaisa sena, hammoho le litaelo tse ling ho kenya index qalong."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.problem4"
msgstr "Re ne re ke ke ra khona ho e atolosa habonolo ho aha likarolo tse ncha, joalo ka <a %(wikipedia_cjk_characters)s>tokenization e betere bakeng sa lipuo tse sa sebeliseng sebaka</a>, ho sefa/ho hlophisa, ho hlophisa, litlhahiso tsa \"na u ne u bolela\", ho tlatsa ka boiketsetso, joalo-joalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text2"
msgstr "Ka mor'a ho bua le litsebi tse ngata, re ile ra khetha ElasticSearch. Ha e so be e phethahetseng (litlhahiso tsa bona tsa \"na u ne u bolela\" le likarolo tsa ho tlatsa ka boiketsetso li mpe), empa ka kakaretso e bile betere haholo ho feta MySQL bakeng sa patlo. Ha re e-so <a %(youtube)s>thabele haholo</a> ho e sebelisa bakeng sa data efe kapa efe ea bohlokoa (leha ba entse <a %(elastic_co)s>tsoelo-pele</a> e ngata), empa ka kakaretso re thabile haholo ka phetoho ena."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.es.text3"
msgstr "Hajoale, re kentse ts'ebetsong patlo e potlakileng haholoanyane, tšehetso e betere ea puo, ho hlophisa ka nepo ho betere, likhetho tse fapaneng tsa ho hlophisa, le ho sefa ka puo/mofuta oa buka/mofuta oa faele. Haeba u labalabela ho tseba hore na e sebetsa joang, <a %(annas_archive_l140)s>sheba</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1115)s>hona</a> <a %(annas_archive_l1635)s>monate</a>. E fumaneha habonolo, leha e ka sebelisa litlhaloso tse ling…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers"
msgstr "300GB+ ea likoahelo tsa libuka e lokollotsoe"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text1"
msgstr "Qetellong, re thabetse ho phatlalatsa tokollo e nyane. Ka tšebelisano le batho ba tsamaisang makala a Libgen.rs, re arolelana likoahelo tsohle tsa libuka tsa bona ka li-torrents le IPFS. Sena se tla aba mojaro oa ho sheba likoahelo har'a mechine e mengata, 'me se tla li boloka hantle. Maemong a mangata (empa eseng kaofela), likoahelo tsa libuka li kenyelelitsoe ka har'a lifaele ka botsona, kahoo sena ke mofuta oa \"data e tsoang\". Empa ho ba le eona ho IPFS ho ntse ho le molemo haholo bakeng sa ts'ebetso ea letsatsi le letsatsi ea Anna’s Archive le makala a fapaneng a Library Genesis."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text2"
msgstr "Joalokaha ho tloaelehile, u ka fumana tokollo ena ho Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: e falliselitsoe ho <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>). Re ke ke ra e hokahanya mona, empa u ka e fumana habonolo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.annas-update-2022.covers.text3"
msgstr "Re tšepa hore re ka fokotsa lebelo la rona hanyane, kaha joale re na le mokhoa o mong o motle ho Z-Library. Mojaro ona oa mosebetsi ha o tšoarelle haholo. Haeba u thahasella ho thusa ka ho ngola mananeo, ts'ebetso ea seva, kapa mosebetsi oa ho boloka, ka sebele ikopanye le rona. Ho ntse ho e-na le <a %(annas_archive)s>mosebetsi o mongata o lokelang ho etsoa</a>. Rea leboha ka thahasello le tšehetso ea hau."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.all-isbns-winners.signature"
msgstr "- Anna le sehlopha (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.title"
msgstr "Anna’s Archive e bolokile laeborari e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea moriti oa metlae lefatšeng (95TB) — u ka thusa ho e jala"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.tldr"
msgstr "Laeborari e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea moriti oa libuka tsa metlae lefatšeng e ne e e-na le ntlha e le 'ngoe ea ho hloleha.. ho fihlela kajeno."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.links"
msgstr "<a %(news_ycombinator)s>Buisana ho Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text1"
msgstr "Laeborari e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea moriti oa libuka tsa metlae e ka 'na ea e-ba ea makala a itseng a Library Genesis: Libgen.li. Motsamaisi a le mong ea tsamaisang sebaka seo o ile a khona ho bokella pokello e makatsang ea metlae e fetang lifaele tse limilione tse 2, e leng kakaretso ea 95TB. Leha ho le joalo, ho fapana le likoleke tse ling tsa Library Genesis, ena e ne e sa fumanehe ka bongata ka li-torrents. U ne u ka fumana metlae ena ka bonngoe feela ka seva ea hae e liehang ea botho — ntlha e le 'ngoe ea ho hloleha. Ho fihlela kajeno!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.text2"
msgstr "Ka posong ena re tla u joetsa ho eketsehileng ka pokello ena, le ka letšolo la rona la ho bokella chelete ho tšehetsa mosebetsi ona o mongata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fig1"
msgstr "<q>Dr. Barbara Gordon o leka ho itahlehela lefatšeng le tloaelehileng la laeborari…</q>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks"
msgstr "Libgen li-fork"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text1"
msgstr "Pele, tse ling tsa semelo. U kanna ua tseba Library Genesis ka pokello ea bona e kholo ea libuka. Batho ba fokolang ba tseba hore baithaopi ba Library Genesis ba thehile merero e meng, joalo ka pokello e kholo ea limakasine le litokomane tse tloaelehileng, bekapo e felletseng ea Sci-Hub (ka tšebelisano le mothehi oa Sci-Hub, Alexandra Elbakyan), le ruri, pokello e kholo ea metlae."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.forks.text2"
msgstr "Ka nako e 'ngoe ba tsamaisang liipone tsa Library Genesis ba ile ba ikarola, e leng se ileng sa baka boemo ba hona joale ba ho ba le \"li-fork\" tse fapaneng, kaofela li ntse li jara lebitso la Library Genesis. Libgen.li fork e na le pokello ena ea metlae ka ho khetheha, hammoho le pokello e kholo ea limakasine (eo le rona re sebetsang ho eona)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration"
msgstr "Tšebelisano"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text1"
msgstr "Ka lebaka la boholo ba eona, pokello ena e bile lenaneng la rona la litakatso ka nako e telele, kahoo ka mor'a katleho ea rona ea ho bekapo Z-Library, re ile ra shebana le pokello ena. Qalong re ile ra e ngola ka kotloloho, e neng e le phephetso e kholo, kaha seva ea bona e ne e sa le maemong a matle. Re ile ra fumana hoo e ka bang 15TB ka tsela ena, empa e ne e tsamaea butle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text2"
msgstr "Ka lehlohonolo, re ile ra khona ho ikopanya le motsamaisi oa laeborari, ea ileng a lumela ho re romella data eohle ka kotloloho, e neng e potlakile haholo. Leha ho le joalo, ho ile ha nka likhoeli tse fetang tse tšeletseng ho fetisetsa le ho sebetsa data eohle, 'me re ile ra batla ra lahleheloa ke eona kaofela ka lebaka la ho senyeha ha disk, e neng e tla bolela ho qala bocha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collaboration.text3"
msgstr "Phihlelo ena e re entse hore re lumele hore ho bohlokoa ho etsa hore data ena e fumanehe kapele kamoo ho ka khonehang, e le hore e ka iponahatsa hohle. Re haufi le ketsahalo e le 'ngoe kapa tse peli tse sa thabiseng tse ka re lahlehelang ke pokello ena ka ho sa feleng!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection"
msgstr "Pokello"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text1"
msgstr "Ho tsamaea ka potlako ho bolela hore pokello e sa hlophiseha hantle… A re shebeng. Nahana hore re na le faele ea faele (eo ha e le hantle re e arolang ka li-torrents):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text2"
msgstr "Direktori ea pele, <code>/repository</code>, ke karolo e hlophisitsoeng haholoanyane ea sena. Direktori ena e na le tse bitsoang \"likete tsa li-dirs\": li-dirs tse nang le lifaele tse likete, tse baloang ka tatellano ho database. Direktori <code>0</code> e na le lifaele tse nang le comic_id 0–999, joalo-joalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text3"
msgstr "Sena ke moralo o tšoanang le oo Library Genesis e neng e o sebelisa bakeng sa lipokello tsa eona tsa lipale le tse seng tsa lipale. Mohopolo ke hore \"kete e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe ea dir\" e fetoloa ka bo eona hore e be torrent hang ha e tlala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text4"
msgstr "Leha ho le joalo, motsamaisi oa Libgen.li ha a ka a etsa li-torrents bakeng sa pokello ena, kahoo likete tsa li-dirs li ile tsa fetoha tse sa lokang, 'me tsa fana ka tsela ea \"li-dirs tse sa hlophisoang\". Tsena ke <code>/comics0</code> ho <code>/comics4</code>. Kaofela li na le meaho e ikhethang ea li-dirs, e neng e ka utloahala bakeng sa ho bokella lifaele, empa ha e utloahale haholo ho rona hona joale. Ka lehlohonolo, metadata e ntse e bua ka lifaele tsena ka kotloloho, kahoo mokhatlo oa tsona oa polokelo ho disk ha o na taba!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.collection.text5"
msgstr "Metadata e fumaneha ka mokhoa oa database ea MySQL. Sena se ka jarollwa ka kotloloho ho tsoa webosaeteng ea Libgen.li, empa re tla boela re e fumane ka torrent, hammoho le tafole ea rona e nang le li-MD5 hashes tsohle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis"
msgstr "Tlhahlobo"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text1"
msgstr "Ha u fumana 95TB e tšolotsoeng ho sehlopha sa hau sa polokelo, u leka ho utloisisa hore na ho na le eng ka hare… Re ile ra etsa tlhahlobo ho bona hore na re ka fokotsa boholo hanyane, joalo ka ka ho tlosa likopi tse tšoanang. Mona ke tse ling tsa liphuputso tsa rona:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item1"
msgstr "Likopi tse tšoanang ka semantic (li-scan tse fapaneng tsa buka e le 'ngoe) li ka sebetsoa ka mokhoa o itseng, empa ho thata. Ha re sheba metlae ka letsoho re ile ra fumana tse ngata tse fosahetseng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item2"
msgstr "Ho na le likopi tse ling ka ho feletseng ka MD5, e leng tšenyo e itseng, empa ho li tlosa ho ne ho tla re fa hoo e ka bang 1%% ea poloko. Ka tekanyo ena ke 1TB, empa hape, ka tekanyo ena 1TB ha e na taba haholo. Re ka mpa ra se kotsing ea ho senya data ka phoso ts'ebetsong ena."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item3"
msgstr "Re fumane data e ngata e seng ea libuka, joalo ka lifilimi tse thehiloeng ho libuka tsa metlae. Hape ho bonahala e le tšenyo, kaha tsena li se li fumaneha haholo ka mekhoa e meng. Leha ho le joalo, re ile ra hlokomela hore re ke ke ra tlosa lifaele tsa lifilimi feela, kaha ho boetse ho na le <em>libuka tsa metlae tse sebelisanang</em> tse ileng tsa lokolloa khomphuteng, tseo motho e mong a li rekotileng 'me a li boloka e le lifilimi."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.item4"
msgstr "Qetellong, eng kapa eng eo re ka e hlakolang pokellong e ne e tla boloka liperesente tse 'maloa feela. Joale re ile ra hopola hore re batho ba ratang ho boloka data, 'me batho ba tla etsang seipone sa sena le bona ke batho ba ratang ho boloka data, kahoo, \"O RE'NG, HLAKOLA?!\" :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.analysis.text2"
msgstr "Ka hona re u hlahisetsa pokello e felletseng, e sa fetoloang. Ke data e ngata, empa re tšepa hore batho ba bangata ba tla tsotella ho e jala leha ho le joalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser"
msgstr "Phutheho ea Chelete"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text1"
msgstr "Re lokolla data ena ka likotoana tse kholo. Torrent ea pele ke ea <code>/comics0</code>, eo re e behileng ka faeleng e le 'ngoe e kholo ea 12TB .tar. Seo se molemo bakeng sa hard drive ea hau le software ea torrent ho feta lifaele tse nyane tse ngata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text2"
msgstr "E le karolo ea tokollo ena, re etsa phutheho ea chelete. Re batla ho bokella $20,000 ho koahela litšenyehelo tsa ts'ebetso le konteraka bakeng sa pokello ena, hammoho le ho nolofalletsa merero e tsoelang pele le e tlang. Re na le tse ling tse kholo tse ntseng li etsoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text3"
msgstr "<em>Ke tšehetsa mang ka monehelo oa ka?</em> Ka bokhutšoanyane: re boloka tsebo le setso sohle sa batho, 'me re etsa hore e fumanehe habonolo. Khoutu le data ea rona kaofela ke open source, re morero o tsamaisoang ka botlalo ke baithaopi, 'me re bolokile libuka tse 125TB ho fihlela joale (ntle le li-torrents tse teng tsa Libgen le Scihub). Qetellong re haha lebili le lumellang le ho khothaletsa batho ho fumana, ho skena, le ho boloka libuka tsohle lefatšeng. Re tla ngola ka moralo oa rona o moholo posong e tlang. :)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text4"
msgstr "Haeba u fana ka monehelo bakeng sa setho sa likhoeli tse 12 sa \"Amazing Archivist\" ($780), u tla <strong>“amohela torrent”</strong>, ho bolelang hore re tla beha lebitso la hau kapa molaetsa faeleng ea e 'ngoe ea li-torrents!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text5"
msgstr "U ka fana ka monehelo ka ho ea ho <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a> le ho tobetsa konopo ea “Donate”. Re boetse re batla baithaopi ba bang: lienjiniere tsa software, bafuputsi ba ts'ireletso, litsebi tsa khoebo tse sa tsejoeng, le bafetoleli. U ka boela ua re tšehetsa ka ho fana ka lits'ebeletso tsa ho amohela. 'Me ehlile, ka kopo jala li-torrents tsa rona!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text6"
msgstr "Re leboha bohle ba seng ba re tšehetse ka seatla se bulehileng! Le hlile le etsa phapang."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text7"
msgstr "Mona ke li-torrents tse lokollotsoeng ho fihlela joale (re ntse re sebetsa ka tse ling):"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.fundraiser.text8"
msgstr "Li-torrents tsohle li ka fumanoa ho <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a> tlasa “Datasets” (ha re hokahanye ka kotloloho moo, kahoo lihokelo tsa blog ena ha li tlosoe ho Reddit, Twitter, joalo-joalo). Ho tloha moo, latela sehokelo sa sebaka sa marang-rang sa Tor."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next"
msgstr "Ho latelang ke eng?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text1"
msgstr "Sehlopha sa li-torrents se loketse ho boloka nako e telele, empa ha se joalo bakeng sa phihlello ea letsatsi le letsatsi. Re tla sebetsa le balekane ba ho amohela ho fumana data ena eohle marang-rang (kaha Anna’s Archive ha e amohele letho ka kotloloho). Ehlile u tla khona ho fumana lihokelo tsena tsa download ho Anna’s Archive."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text2"
msgstr "Re boetse re mema bohle ho etsa lintho ka data ena! Re thuse ho e sekaseka hantle, ho e kopanya, ho e beha ho IPFS, ho e kopanya, ho koetlisa mehlala ea hau ea AI ka eona, joalo-joalo. Ke ea hau kaofela, 'me re ke ke ra ema ho bona seo u se etsang ka eona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text3"
msgstr "Qetellong, joalo ka ha ho boletsoe pele, re ntse re na le litokollo tse kholo tse tlang (haeba <em>mang kapa mang</em> a ka <em>romela ka phoso</em> dump ea <em>database e itseng</em> ea ACS4, ua tseba moo u ka re fumanang…), hammoho le ho haha lebili la ho boloka libuka tsohle lefatšeng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.next.text4"
msgstr "Kahoo lula u mametse, re sa tsoa qala."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.backed-up-libgen-li.signature"
msgstr "- Anna le sehlopha (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.title"
msgstr "Libuka tse ncha tse 3x li eketsoa ho Pirate Library Mirror (+24TB, libuka tse limilione tse 3.8)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.text1"
msgstr "Tokollong ea pele ea Pirate Library Mirror (EDIT: e falliselitsoe ho <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>), re ile ra etsa seipone sa Z-Library, pokello e kholo ea libuka tse seng molaong. Joaloka khopotso, ena ke seo re se ngotseng posong eo ea blog ea pele:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.3x-new-books.q1.text1"
msgstr "Z-Library ke laeborari e tummeng (le e seng molaong). Ba nkile pokello ea Library Genesis 'me ba e etsa hore e batlisoe habonolo. Holim'a moo, ba fetohile ba atlehileng haholo ho kopa menehelo ea libuka tse ncha, ka ho khothaletsa basebelisi ba fanang ka melemo e fapaneng. Hajoale ha ba khutlisetse libuka tsena tse ncha ho Library Genesis. 'Me ho fapana le Library Genesis, ha ba etse hore pokello ea bona e be bonolo ho e etsisa, e thibelang ho bolokoa ka bophara. Sena se bohlokoa ho mohlala oa bona oa khoebo, kaha ba lefisa chelete bakeng sa ho fumana pokello ea bona ka bongata (ho feta libuka tse 10 ka letsatsi)."

