#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text4"
msgstr "Tse ling tsa lintho tsena li fapane haholo le tse ling hore re ka tšoenyeha ka tsona (kapa li se li ntse li hlokomeloa ke mekhatlo e meng), joalo ka lintlha tsa tlhaho kapa lintlha tsa libaka. Empa boholo ba lintho tse lenaneng lena li bohlokoa ho rona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.text5"
msgstr "Ntho e 'ngoe e kholo e amang boemo ba rona ke hore na mosebetsi o itseng o kotsing hakae. Re khetha ho tsepamisa maikutlo mosebetsing o:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.priorities.rarity.rare"
