#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib"
msgstr "Lilaeborari tsa moriti"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text1"
msgstr "Ho na le mekhatlo e mengata e nang le merero e tšoanang, le lintho tse tlang pele tse tšoanang. Ehlile, ho na le lilaeborari, lirekoto, lilaboratori, limusiamo, le mekhatlo e meng e ikarabellang bakeng sa ho boloka mofuta ona. Tse ngata tsa tsona li na le lichelete tse ngata, ke mebuso, batho ka bomong, kapa likhoebo. Empa li na le bothata bo boholo: tsamaiso ea molao."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text2"
msgstr "Mona ke moo karolo e ikhethang ea lilaeborari tsa moriti e leng teng, le lebaka leo ka lona Anna’s Archive e leng teng. Re ka etsa lintho tseo mekhatlo e meng e sa lumelloang ho li etsa. Joale, ha se (hangata) hore re ka boloka lintho tse seng molaong ho li boloka kae kapa kae. Che, ho molaong libakeng tse ngata ho aha laeborari ka libuka leha e le life, lipampiri, limakasine, joalo-joalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text3"
msgstr "Empa seo liqepheto tsa molao hangata li haellang ke <strong>ho pheta-pheta le ho tšoarella</strong>. Ho na le libuka tseo ho nang le kopi e le 'ngoe feela e teng laeboraring e itseng e teng kae-kae. Ho na le lirekoto tsa metadata tse sirelelitsoeng ke k'hamphani e le 'ngoe. Ho na le likoranta tse bolokiloeng feela ka microfilm polokelong e le 'ngoe. Laeborari li ka fokotsoa lichelete, lik'hamphani li ka putlama, liqepheto li ka thunngoa le ho chesoa fatše. Sena ha se ntho e ncha — sena se etsahala ka linako tsohle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text4"
msgstr "Ntho eo re ka e etsang ka mokhoa o ikhethang ho Anna’s Archive ke ho boloka likopi tse ngata tsa mesebetsi, ka bongata. Re ka bokella lipampiri, libuka, limakasine, le tse ling, 'me ra li aba ka bongata. Hajoale re etsa sena ka li-torrents, empa mahlale a nepahetseng ha a amehe 'me a tla fetoha ha nako e ntse e ea. Karolo ea bohlokoa ke ho aba likopi tse ngata lefatšeng ka bophara. Mantsoe ana a tsoang lilemong tse fetang 200 tse fetileng a ntse a le 'nete:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.quote.the-lost"
msgstr "<em><q>Se lahlehileng se ke ke sa fumanoa hape; empa a re pholoseng se setseng: eseng ka matlo a polokelo le likhoka tse ba sireletsang mahlong a sechaba le tšebeliso, ka ho ba nehelana ka nako, empa ka ho atisa likopi, tse tla ba beha ka nqane ho kotsi ea kotsi.</q></em><br>— Thomas Jefferson, 1791"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.text5"
msgstr "Tlhokomeliso e potlakileng ka domain ea sechaba. Kaha Anna’s Archive e ikhethang e tsepamisitse maikutlo mesebetsing e seng molaong libakeng tse ngata lefatšeng, ha re tsotelle likoleke tse fumanehang haholo, tse kang libuka tsa domain ea sechaba. Mekhatlo ea molao hangata e se e ntse e hlokomela hantle seo. Leha ho le joalo, ho na le lintlha tse nahanang tse etsang hore ka linako tse ling re sebetse likoleke tse fumanehang phatlalatsa:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.metadata"
msgstr "Lirekoto tsa metadata li ka shejoa mahala webosaeteng ea Worldcat, empa ha li jarollwe ka bongata (ho fihlela re <a %(worldcat_scrape)s>li qotsitse</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.github"
msgstr "Khoutu e ka ba open source ho Github, empa Github ka kakaretso e ke ke ea bonahala habonolo 'me ka hona ea bolokoa (leha tabeng ena ho na le likopi tse lekaneng tse ajoang tsa li-repositories tse ngata tsa khoutu)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.shadowlib.example.reddit"
msgstr "Reddit e lokolohile ho e sebelisa, empa haufinyane e kentse mehato e thata ea ho thibela ho qotswa, ka lebaka la koetliso ea LLM e lapileng data (ho feta ka seo hamorao)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies"
msgstr "Ho atisa likopi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text1"
msgstr "Re khutlela potso ea rona ea mantlha: re ka bolela joang hore re tla boloka likoleke tsa rona ka ho sa feleng? Bothata bo boholo mona ke hore pokello ea rona e bile <a %(torrents_stats)s>e hola</a> ka potlako, ka ho qotsa le ho bula mehloli ea likoleke tse kholo (ka holim'a mosebetsi o makatsang o seng o entsoe ke laeborari tse ling tsa data tse kang Sci-Hub le Library Genesis)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.copies.text2"
msgstr "Keketseho ena ea data e etsa hore ho be thata hore likoleke li bonahale lefatšeng ka bophara. Polokelo ea data e theko e boima! Empa re na le tšepo, haholo-holo ha re sheba mekhoa e meraro e latelang."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit"
msgstr "1. Re nkile litholoana tse tlase"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text1"
msgstr "Sena se latela ka ho toba ho tsoa ho lintho tseo re li behileng pele tse boletsoeng ka holimo. Re khetha ho sebetsa ho lokolla likoleke tse kholo pele. Joale kaha re se re sirelelitse tse ling tsa likoleke tse kholo ka ho fetisisa lefatšeng, re lebelletse hore kholo ea rona e tla ba butle haholoanyane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.low-hanging-fruit.text2"
msgstr "Ho ntse ho na le mohatla o molelele oa likoleke tse nyenyane, 'me libuka tse ncha li ntse li hlahlojoa kapa li phatlalatsoa letsatsi le leng le le leng, empa sekhahla se tla ba butle haholoanyane. Re ka 'na ra ntse re imena habeli kapa hararo ka boholo, empa ka nako e telele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage"
msgstr "2. Litsenyehelo tsa polokelo li ntse li theoha ka potlako"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text1"
msgstr "Ha re ngola, <a %(diskprices)s>theko ea disk</a> ka TB e ka bang $12 bakeng sa li-disk tse ncha, $8 bakeng sa li-disk tse sebelisitsoeng, le $4 bakeng sa teipi. Haeba re le hlokolosi 'me re sheba feela li-disk tse ncha, seo se bolela hore ho boloka petabyte ho bitsa hoo e ka bang $12,000. Haeba re nka hore laeborari ea rona e tla imena hararo ho tloha ho 900TB ho ea ho 2.7PB, seo se tla bolela $32,400 ho bonahatsa laeborari ea rona kaofela. Ho eketsa motlakase, litšenyehelo tsa lisebelisoa tse ling, joalo-joalo, a re e akaretseng ho $40,000. Kapa ka teipi e ka ba $15,000–$20,000."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text2"
msgstr "Ka lehlakoreng le leng <strong>$15,000–$40,000 bakeng sa kakaretso ea tsebo eohle ea batho ke theko e tlase</strong>. Ka lehlakoreng le leng, ho batla ho le boima ho lebelletsoe likopi tse ngata tse felletseng, haholo-holo haeba re ka rata hore batho bao ba tsoele pele ho jala li-torrents tsa bona molemong oa ba bang."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text3"
msgstr "Seo ke kajeno. Empa tsoelo-pele e tsoela pele:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text4"
msgstr "Litsenyehelo tsa hard drive ka TB li fokotsehile ka karolo ea boraro lilemong tse 10 tse fetileng, 'me li tla tsoela pele ho theoha ka lebelo le tšoanang. Teipi e bonahala e le tseleng e tšoanang. Litheko tsa SSD li ntse li theoha ka potlako le ho feta, 'me li ka nka litheko tsa HDD qetellong ea lilemo tse leshome."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.hdd-prices"
msgstr "Mekhoa ea litheko tsa HDD e tsoang mehloling e fapaneng (tlanya ho sheba thuto)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.text5"
msgstr "Haeba sena se tšoarella, joale ka mor'a lilemo tse 10 re ka 'na ra sheba feela $5,000–$13,000 ho bonahatsa pokello ea rona eohle (1/3), kapa le ka tlase haeba re hola ka boholo bo fokolang. Le hoja e ntse e le chelete e ngata, sena se tla fumaneha ho batho ba bangata. 'Me e ka ba betere le ho feta ka lebaka la ntlha e latelang…"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density"
msgstr "3. Lintlafatso tse ntlafetseng tsa tlhahisoleseling"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text1"
msgstr "Hajoale re boloka libuka ka lifomate tse tala tseo re li fuoang. Ehlile, li hatelitsoe, empa hangata li ntse li le likhatiso tse kholo kapa linepe tsa maqephe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text2"
msgstr "Ho fihlela joale, likhetho tse le 'ngoe feela tsa ho fokotsa boholo ba pokello ea rona e bile ka ho hatella ka matla, kapa ho fokotsa likopi tse tšoanang. Leha ho le joalo, ho fumana poloko e lekaneng, ka bobeli li lahleheloa haholo ke boleng boo re bo batlang. Ho hatella haholo linepe ho ka etsa hore mongolo o be thata ho o bala. 'Me ho fokotsa likopi tse tšoanang ho hloka ts'epo e phahameng ea hore libuka li tšoana hantle, e leng hangata ho sa nepahalang, haholo haeba litaba li tšoana empa likhatiso li entsoe ka linako tse fapaneng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text3"
msgstr "Kamehla ho bile le khetho ea boraro, empa boleng ba eona bo bile bobe hoo re sa kang ra e nahana: <strong>OCR, kapa Optical Character Recognition</strong>. Ena ke ts'ebetso ea ho fetolela linepe ho ba mongolo o hlakileng, ka ho sebelisa AI ho lemoha litlhaku linepeng. Lisebelisoa tsa sena li bile teng nako e telele, 'me li bile li le ntle haholo, empa \"e ntle haholo\" ha e lekane bakeng sa merero ea polokelo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text4"
msgstr "Leha ho le joalo, mehlala ea morao-rao ea ho ithuta ka botebo e entse tsoelo-pele e potlakileng haholo, leha e ntse e le ka litšenyehelo tse phahameng. Re lebelletse hore ho nepahala le litšenyehelo li tla ntlafala haholo lilemong tse tlang, ho isa ntlheng eo e tla ba ntho ea sebele ho e sebelisa pokellong eohle ea rona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.ocr"
msgstr "Lintlafatso tsa OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text5"
msgstr "Ha seo se etsahala, re tla ka 'na ra boloka lifaele tsa mantlha, empa hape re ka ba le mofuta o monyenyane haholo oa laeborari ea rona eo batho ba bangata ba tla batla ho e etsisa. Ntho e khahlisang ke hore mongolo o hlakileng o hatella le ho feta, 'me ho bonolo haholo ho fokotsa likopi tse tšoanang, ho re fa poloko e eketsehileng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.storage.density.text6"
msgstr "Ka kakaretso ha ho ntho e sa utloahaleng ho lebella bonyane phokotso ea 5-10x ka boholo ba faele ka kakaretso, mohlomong le ho feta. Le ka phokotso e itekanetseng ea 5x, re tla sheba <strong> $1,000–$3,000 ka lilemo tse 10 leha laeborari ea rona e eketseha ka makhetlo a mararo</strong>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window"
msgstr "Fensetere ea bohlokoa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text1"
msgstr "Haeba likhakanyo tsena li nepahetse, re <strong>hloka feela ho ema lilemo tse 'maloa</strong> pele pokello ea rona eohle e tla etsisoa haholo. Ka mantsoe a Thomas Jefferson, \"e behiloe ka nqane ho phoso.\""

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text2"
msgstr "Ka bomalimabe, ho hlaha ha LLMs, le koetliso ea tsona e jang data e ngata, ho behile beng ba litokelo tsa molao ba bangata ba le boemong ba ho itšireletsa. Le ho feta kamoo ba neng ba se ba ntse ba le kateng. Liwebosaete tse ngata li etsa hore ho be thata ho kuta le ho boloka, linyeoe li ntse li phahama, 'me ka nako eohle laeborari le li-archive tsa 'mele li ntse li hlokomolohuoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text3"
msgstr "Re ka lebella feela hore mekhoa ena e tsoele pele ho mpefala, 'me mesebetsi e mengata e lahlehe pele e kena phatlalatsong."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text4"
msgstr "<strong>Re mothating oa phetoho e kholo polokelong, empa <q>tse lahlehileng li ke ke tsa fumanoa hape.</q></strong> Re na le fensetere ea bohlokoa ea lilemo tse ka bang 5-10 moo ho ntseng ho le theko e boima ho sebetsa laeborari e patiloeng le ho theha likopi tse ngata lefatšeng ka bophara, 'me moo phihlello e so koaloe ka ho feletseng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text5"
msgstr "Haeba re ka tšela fensetere ena, re tla be re bolokile tsebo le setso sa batho ka ho sa feleng. Ha rea lokela ho lumella nako ena ho senyeha. Ha rea lokela ho lumella fensetere ena ea bohlokoa ho koala ho rona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.the-window.text6"
msgstr "A re eeng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.critical-window.signature"
msgstr "- Anna le sehlopha (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.title"
msgstr "Phihlello e ikhethang bakeng sa lik'hamphani tsa LLM pokellong e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea libuka tsa 'nete tsa Sechaena lefatšeng"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.subtitle"
msgstr "<a %(duxiu_exclusive_chinese)s>Mofuta oa Sechaena 中文版</a>, <a %(news_ycombinator)s>Buisana ho Hacker News</a>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Anna’s Archive e fumane pokello e ikhethang ea libuka tsa 'nete tsa Sechaena tse limilione tse 7.5 / 350TB — e kholo ho feta Library Genesis. Re ikemiselitse ho fa k'hamphani ea LLM phihlello e ikhethang, ka phapanyetsano bakeng sa OCR ea boleng bo phahameng le ho ntša mongolo.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text1"
msgstr "Sena ke poso e khuts'oane ea blog. Re batla k'hamphani kapa setheo se seng ho re thusa ka OCR le ho ntša mongolo bakeng sa pokello e kholo eo re e fumaneng, ka phapanyetsano bakeng sa phihlello e ikhethang ea pele. Ka mor'a nako ea thibelo, re tla lokolla pokello eohle."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text2"
msgstr "Lingoliloeng tsa boleng bo phahameng tsa thuto li thusa haholo ho koetliseng LLMs. Le ha pokello ea rona e le ea Sechaena, sena se lokela ho ba molemo le ho koetliseng LLMs tsa Senyesemane: mehlala e bonahala e kenyelletsa mehopolo le tsebo ho sa tsotellehe puo ea mohloli."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text3"
msgstr "Bakeng sa sena, mongolo o hloka ho ntšoa ho tsoa ho li-scan. Anna’s Archive e fumana eng ho sena? Patlo ea mongolo o felletseng ea libuka bakeng sa basebelisi ba eona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.text4"
msgstr "Hobane lipakane tsa rona li lumellana le tsa bahlahisi ba LLM, re batla ho sebelisana. Re ikemiselitse ho u fa <strong>phihlello e ikhethang ea pele ho pokello ena ka bongata bakeng sa selemo se le seng</strong>, haeba u ka etsa OCR le ho ntša mongolo ka nepo. Haeba u ikemiselitse ho arolelana khoutu eohle ea pipeline ea hau le rona, re tla ikemisetsa ho thibela pokello ka nako e telele."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages"
msgstr "Maqephe a mohlala"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text1"
msgstr "Ho re paka hore u na le pipeline e ntle, mona ke maqephe a mohlala ho qala ka ona, a tsoang bukeng e buang ka superconductors. Pipeline ea hau e lokela ho sebetsana hantle le lipalo, litafoleng, lichate, lintlha tse tlase, joalo-joalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.example_pages.text2"
msgstr "Romela maqephe a hau a sebetsitsoeng ho lengolo-tsoibila la rona. Haeba a shebahala hantle, re tla u romella a mang ka lekunutu, 'me re lebelletse hore u tla khona ho tsamaisa pipeline ea hau ka potlako le ho ona. Hang ha re khotsofetse, re ka etsa tumellano."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection"
msgstr "Pokello"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text1"
msgstr "Tse ling ka pokello. <a %(duxiu)s>Duxiu</a> ke polokelo e kholo ea libuka tse scaneng, e entsoeng ke <a %(chaoxing)s>SuperStar Digital Library Group</a>. Boholo ke libuka tsa thuto, tse scaneng ho etsa hore li fumanehe ka dijithale ho liunivesithi le lilaebrari. Bakeng sa bamameli ba rona ba buang Senyesemane, <a %(library_princeton)s>Princeton</a> le <a %(guides_lib_uw)s>Univesithi ea Washington</a> ba na le kakaretso e ntle. Ho boetse ho na le sengoloa se setle se fanang ka semelo se eketsehileng: <a %(doi)s>“Digitizing Chinese Books: A Case Study of the SuperStar DuXiu Scholar Search Engine”</a> (e shebe ho Anna’s Archive)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text2"
msgstr "Libuka tse tsoang Duxiu li 'nile tsa utsuoa nako e telele inthaneteng ea Chaena. Hangata li rekisoa ka tlase ho dolara ke barekisi. Hangata li ajoa ka mokhoa o tšoanang le Google Drive ea Chaena, e atisang ho qhekelloa ho lumella sebaka se eketsehileng sa polokelo. Lintlha tse ling tsa tekheniki li ka fumanoa <a %(github_duty_machine)s>mona</a> le <a %(github_821_github_io)s>mona</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text3"
msgstr "Le hoja libuka li 'nile tsa ajoa ka mokhoa o itseng, ho thata haholo ho li fumana ka bongata. Re ne re e-na le sena holimo lethathamong la rona la TODO, 'me re nehela likhoeli tse ngata tsa mosebetsi oa nako e tletseng bakeng sa eona. Leha ho le joalo, haufinyane, moithaopi ea makatsang, ea hlollang, le ea nang le talenta o ile a ikopanya le rona, a re bolella hore ba se ba entse mosebetsi oohle ona — ka litšenyehelo tse kholo. Ba arolelane pokello eohle le rona, ntle le ho lebella letho ka ho khutla, ntle le tiiso ea polokelo ea nako e telele. E hlile e makatsa. Ba ile ba lumela ho kopa thuso ka tsela ena ho fumana pokello e etsoang OCR."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text4"
msgstr "Pokello e na le lifaele tse 7,543,702. Sena se feta Library Genesis non-fiction (hoo e ka bang limilione tse 5.3). Boholo ba lifaele ka kakaretso ke hoo e ka bang 359TB (326TiB) ka sebopeho sa eona sa hajoale."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.collection.text5"
msgstr "Re bulehetse litlhahiso le mehopolo e meng. Ikopanye le rona feela. Sheba Anna’s Archive bakeng sa tlhaiso-leseling e eketsehileng ka likoleke tsa rona, boiteko ba polokelo, le kamoo u ka thusang kateng. Kea leboha!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.duxiu-exclusive.signoff"
msgstr "- Anna le sehlopha (<a %(reddit)s>Reddit</a>, <a %(t_me)s>Telegram</a>)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Temoso: poso ena ea blog e se e felisitsoe. Re nkile qeto ea hore IPFS ha e so itokisetse nako ea eona. Re ntse re tla hokahanya lifaele ho IPFS ho tsoa ho Anna’s Archive ha ho khoneha, empa ha re sa tla e amohela ka borona, ebile ha re khothaletse ba bang ho e etsisa ba sebelisa IPFS. Ka kopo bona leqephe la rona la Torrents haeba u batla ho thusa ho boloka pokello ea rona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.zlib-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Thusa ho jala Z-Library ho IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.title"
msgstr "Mokhoa oa ho tsamaisa laeborari ea moriti: ts'ebetso ho Anna’s Archive"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tldr"
msgstr "Ha ho na <q>AWS bakeng sa liphallelo tsa moriti,</q> kahoo re tsamaisa Anna’s Archive joang?"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text1"
msgstr "Ke tsamaisa <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, enjene e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea patlo e bulehileng ea liphallelo tsa moriti lefatšeng, joalo ka Sci-Hub, Library Genesis, le Z-Library. Sepheo sa rona ke ho etsa hore tsebo le setso li fumanehe habonolo, 'me qetellong ho theha sechaba sa batho ba kopaneng ho boloka le ho sireletsa <a %(blog_isbndb_dump_how_many_books_are_preserved_forever)s>libuka tsohle lefatšeng</a>."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text2"
msgstr "Sehloohong sena ke tla bontša kamoo re tsamaisang sebaka sena sa marang-rang, le mathata a ikhethang a tlang le ho tsamaisa sebaka sa marang-rang se nang le boemo bo belaetsang ba molao, kaha ha ho na “AWS bakeng sa liphallelo tsa moriti”."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.text3"
msgstr "<em>Hape sheba sengoloa sa khaitseli <a %(blog_how_to_become_a_pirate_archivist)s>Mokhoa oa ho ba moqolotsi oa litaba oa pirate</a>.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens"
msgstr "Likhatholla tsa boqapi"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text1"
msgstr "A re qaleng ka theknoloji eo re e sebelisang. E etselitsoe ka boomo hore e be e sa thabiseng. Re sebelisa Flask, MariaDB, le ElasticSearch. Ke eona feela. Patlo e se e rarollotsoe haholo, 'me ha re ikemisetse ho e qapa bocha. Ntle le moo, re tlameha ho sebelisa <a %(mcfunley)s>likhatholla tsa rona tsa boqapi</a> ho hong ho hong: ho se tlosoe ke balaoli."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text2"
msgstr "Joale Anna’s Archive e molaong kapa ha e molaong hakae? Sena se itšetlehile haholo ka sebaka sa molao. Linaha tse ngata li lumela ka mofuta o itseng oa litokelo tsa molao, tse bolelang hore batho kapa lik'hamphani li fuoa tokelo e ikhethang ea mesebetsi e itseng ka nako e itseng. Ka lehlakoreng le leng, ho Anna’s Archive re lumela hore le hoja ho na le melemo e meng, ka kakaretso litokelo tsa molao ke kotsi ho sechaba — empa ke pale ea nako e 'ngoe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text3"
msgstr "Tokelo ena e ikhethang ea mesebetsi e itseng e bolela hore ho seng molaong hore mang kapa mang kantle ho tokelo ena a aba mesebetsi eo ka kotloloho — ho kenyeletsa le rona. Empa Anna’s Archive ke enjene ea ho batla e sa abeng mesebetsi eo ka kotloloho (bonyane eseng webosaeteng ea rona e hlakileng), kahoo re lokela ho ba hantle, na ha ho joalo? Ha ho joalo hantle. Libakeng tse ngata tsa molao ha ho molaong feela ho aba mesebetsi e nang le litokelo tsa molao, empa le ho hokahanya le libaka tse etsang joalo. Mohlala o tloaelehileng oa sena ke molao oa DMCA oa United States."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text4"
msgstr "Ke pheletso e thata ka ho fetisisa ea sekala. Ka lehlakoreng le leng la sekala ho ka ba le linaha tse se nang melao ea litokelo tsa molao ho hang, empa tsena ha li eo ka nnete. Hoo e batlang e le naha e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe e na le mofuta o itseng oa molao oa litokelo tsa molao. Tlhokomelo ke pale e fapaneng. Ho na le linaha tse ngata tse nang le mebuso e sa tsotelleng ho tiisa molao oa litokelo tsa molao. Ho boetse ho na le linaha tse pakeng tsa maemo a mabeli, tse thibelang ho aba mesebetsi e nang le litokelo tsa molao, empa ha li thibele ho hokahanya le mesebetsi e joalo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text5"
msgstr "Taba e 'ngoe ke boemong ba k'hamphani. Haeba k'hamphani e sebetsa sebakeng sa molao se sa tsotelleng litokelo tsa molao, empa k'hamphani ka boeona e sa ikemisetsa ho ipeha kotsing, e ka koala webosaete ea hau hang ha motho e mong a tletleba ka eona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.innovation-tokens.text6"
msgstr "Qetellong, taba e kholo ke litefo. Kaha re hloka ho lula re sa tsejoe, re ke ke ra sebelisa mekhoa ea setso ea ho lefa. Sena se re siea le li-cryptocurrencies, 'me ke karolo e nyane feela ea lik'hamphani tse tšehetsang tsona (ho na le likarete tsa mekitlane tse lefuoang ka crypto, empa hangata ha li amoheloe)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture"
msgstr "Sebopeho sa tsamaiso"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text1"
msgstr "Kahoo a re re u fumane lik'hamphani tse ikemiselitseng ho amohela webosaete ea hau ntle le ho u koala — a re ba bitse “bafani ba ratang tokoloho” 😄. U tla fumana kapele hore ho amohela tsohle le bona ho bitsa chelete e ngata, kahoo u ka 'na ua batla ho fumana “bafani ba theko e tlaase” 'me u etse kamohelo ea sebele moo, u fetisetsa ka bafani ba ratang tokoloho. Haeba u e etsa ka nepo, bafani ba theko e tlaase ba ke ke ba tseba hore na u amohela eng, 'me ba ke ke ba fumana litletlebo."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text2"
msgstr "Ka bafani bana kaofela ho na le kotsi ea hore ba u koale leha ho le joalo, kahoo u boetse u hloka ho ba le likopi. Re hloka sena maemong 'ohle a sehlopha sa rona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text3"
msgstr "Khamphani e 'ngoe e batlang e rata tokoloho e iketselitseng boemo bo khahlisang ke Cloudflare. Ba <a %(blog_cloudflare)s>hlalositse</a> hore ha se mofani oa kamohelo, empa ke utility, joalo ka ISP. Ka hona ha ba tlas'a DMCA kapa likopo tse ling tsa ho tlosoa, 'me ba fetisetsa likopo life kapa life ho mofani oa kamohelo ea hau ea sebele. Ba bile ba ile ba ea lekhotleng ho sireletsa sebopeho sena. Ka hona re ka ba sebelisa e le sehlopha se seng sa ho boloka le ho sireletsa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text4"
msgstr "Cloudflare ha e amohele litefo tse sa tsejoeng, kahoo re ka sebelisa feela moralo oa bona oa mahala. Sena se bolela hore re ke ke ra sebelisa likarolo tsa bona tsa ho leka-lekana ha mojaro kapa ho hlōleha. Ka hona re <a %(annas_archive_l255)s>e kentse tšebetsong ka borona</a> boemong ba domain. Ha leqephe le jarisoa, sebatli se tla hlahloba hore na domain ea hajoale e ntse e fumaneha, 'me haeba e sa fumanehe, e ngola li-URL tsohle ho domain e fapaneng. Kaha Cloudflare e boloka maqephe a mangata, sena se bolela hore mosebelisi a ka fihla ho domain ea rona e kholo, leha seva sa proxy se le tlase, 'me ka nako e tlang a fetisetsoe ho domain e 'ngoe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text5"
msgstr "Re ntse re na le litaba tse tloaelehileng tsa ts'ebetso tseo re lokelang ho sebetsana le tsona, tse kang ho hlahloba bophelo bo botle ba seva, ho ngola liphoso tsa backend le frontend, joalo-joalo. Sebopeho sa rona sa ho hlōleha se lumella ho tiea haholoanyane lehlakoreng lena hape, mohlala ka ho tsamaisa sehlopha se fapaneng ka ho feletseng sa li-server ho e 'ngoe ea li-domain. Re ka ba ra tsamaisa mefuta ea khale ea khoutu le datasets ho domain ena e arohaneng, haeba ho na le phoso e kholo phetolelong e kholo e sa bonoe."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.architecture.text6"
msgstr "Re ka boela ra itšireletsa khahlanong le Cloudflare e re fetohela, ka ho e tlosa ho e 'ngoe ea li-domain, joalo ka domain ena e arohaneng. Liphetoho tse fapaneng tsa mehopolo ena li a khoneha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools"
msgstr "Lisebelisoa"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text1"
msgstr "A re shebeng hore na re sebelisa lisebelisoa life ho phethahatsa sena sohle. Sena se ntse se fetoha haholo ha re kopana le mathata a macha le ho fumana tharollo e ncha."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.app"
msgstr "Seva ea kopo: Flask, MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Docker."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.proxy"
msgstr "Seva ea proxy: Varnish."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.management"
msgstr "Tsamaiso ea seva: Ansible, Checkmk, UFW."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.dev"
msgstr "Nts'etsopele: Gitlab, Weblate, Zulip."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.onion"
msgstr "Onion static hosting: Tor, Nginx."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text2"
msgstr "Ho na le liqeto tse ling tseo re 'nileng ra li fetola khafetsa. E 'ngoe ke puisano pakeng tsa li-server: re ne re tloaetse ho sebelisa Wireguard bakeng sa sena, empa re fumane hore ka linako tse ling e emisa ho fetisa data efe kapa efe, kapa e fetisa data ka tsela e le 'ngoe feela. Sena se etsahetse ka litlhophiso tse fapaneng tsa Wireguard tseo re li lekileng, tse kang <a %(github_costela_wesher)s>wesher</a> le <a %(github_k4yt3x_wg_meshconf)s>wg-meshconf</a>. Re boetse re lekile ho tsamaisa likou ka SSH, re sebelisa autossh le sshuttle, empa ra kopana le <a %(github_sshuttle)s>mathata moo</a> (leha ho ntse ho sa hlake ho 'na hore na autossh e na le mathata a TCP-over-TCP kapa che — ho bonahala e le tharollo e sa tsitsang ho 'na empa mohlomong e lokile?)."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text3"
msgstr "Sebakeng seo, re khutletse ho likhokahano tse tobileng pakeng tsa li-server, re pata hore seva e sebetsa ho bafani ba theko e tlaase ka ho sebelisa IP-filtering le UFW. Sena se na le bothata ba hore Docker ha e sebetse hantle le UFW, ntle le haeba u sebelisa <code>network_mode: \"host\"</code>. Tsena tsohle li na le monyetla o moholo oa liphoso, hobane u tla pepesa seva ea hau inthaneteng ka phoso e nyane feela ea tlhophiso. Mohlomong re lokela ho khutlela ho autossh — maikutlo a tla amoheloa ka mofuthu mona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text4"
msgstr "Re boetse re 'nileng ra fetola Varnish le Nginx. Hajoale re rata Varnish, empa e na le mefokolo le mathata a eona. Ho tšoana le Checkmk: ha re e rate haholo, empa e sebetsa hajoale. Weblate e bile hantle empa ha e hlollang — ka linako tse ling ke tšaba hore e tla lahleheloa ke data ea ka neng kapa neng ha ke leka ho e hokahanya le repo ea rona ea git. Flask e bile hantle ka kakaretso, empa e na le mefokolo e makatsang e nkileng nako e ngata ho e lokisa, joalo ka ho hlophisa libaka tse ikhethileng, kapa mathata ka kopanyo ea eona ea SqlAlchemy."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.tools.text5"
msgstr "Ho fihlela joale lisebelisoa tse ling li bile ntle haholo: ha re na litletlebo tse tebileng ka MariaDB, ElasticSearch, Gitlab, Zulip, Docker, le Tor. Tsena kaofela li bile le mathata a mang, empa ha ho letho le tebileng kapa le nkang nako e ngata."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions"
msgstr "Qetello"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text1"
msgstr "E bile boiphihlelo bo khahlisang ho ithuta ho theha enjene ea ho batla laeborari ea moriti e matla le e tsitsitseng. Ho na le lintlha tse ngata tse ling tseo re tla li arolelana posong e tlang, kahoo mpolelle hore na u ka rata ho ithuta ho eketsehileng ka eng!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.how-to-run.conclusions.text2"
msgstr "Joaloka kamehla, re batla menehelo ho tšehetsa mosebetsi ona, kahoo etsa bonnete ba hore u sheba leqephe la Donate ho Anna’s Archive. Re boetse re batla mefuta e meng ea tšehetso, joalo ka lithuso, batšehetsi ba nako e telele, bafani ba tefo ba kotsing e phahameng, mohlomong le lipapatso (tse nang le tatso!). 'Me haeba u batla ho kenya letsoho ka nako le litsebo tsa hau, re lula re batla bahlahisi, bafetoleli, joalo-joalo. Kea leboha ka thahasello le tšehetso ea hau."

#, fuzzy
