#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.title"
msgstr "1.3B WorldCat scrape"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.title"
msgstr "Ho beha libuka tse 5,998,794 ho IPFS"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.books-on-ipfs.deprecated"
msgstr "Temoso: poso ena ea blog e se e felisitsoe. Re nkile qeto ea hore IPFS ha e so itokisetse nako ea eona. Re ntse re tla hokahanya lifaele ho IPFS ho tsoa ho Anna’s Archive ha ho khoneha, empa ha re sa tla e amohela ka borona, ebile ha re khothaletse ba bang ho e etsisa ba sebelisa IPFS. Ka kopo bona leqephe la rona la Torrents haeba u batla ho thusa ho boloka pokello ea rona."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.tldr"
msgstr "<em><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Anna’s Archive e ile ea hlakola WorldCat kaofela (pokello e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea metadata ea laeborari lefatšeng) ho etsa lethathamo la libuka tse hlokang ho bolokoa.</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text1"
msgstr "Selemo se fetileng, re ile ra <a %(blog)s>ikemisetsa</a> ho araba potso ena: <strong>Ke liperesente tse kae tsa libuka tse bolokiloeng ka ho sa feleng ke laeborari tsa moriti?</strong>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text2"
msgstr "Hang ha buka e kena laeboraring ea moriti e bulehileng ea data joalo ka <a %(wikipedia_library_genesis)s>Library Genesis</a>, 'me hona joale <a %(wikipedia_annas_archive)s>Anna’s Archive</a>, e bonahatsoa lefatšeng ka bophara (ka li-torrents), ka hona e e boloka ka ho sa feleng."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text3"
msgstr "Ho araba potso ea hore na ke liperesente tse kae tsa libuka tse bolokiloeng, re hloka ho tseba palo eohle: ke libuka tse kae tse teng ka kakaretso? 'Me ka ho phethahetseng ha re na feela nomoro, empa le metadata ea sebele. Joale re ka bapisa tsona le laeborari tsa moriti, empa hape <strong>re thehe lethathamo la libuka tse setseng tse lokelang ho bolokoa!</strong> Re ka 'na ra qala ho lora ka boiteko bo kopanetsoeng ba ho theoha lethathamong lena la libuka tse lokelang ho bolokoa."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text4"
msgstr "Re ile ra ngola <a %(wikipedia_isbndb_com)s>ISBNdb</a>, 'me ra jarolla <a %(openlibrary)s>Open Library dataset</a>, empa liphetho li ne li sa khotsofatse. Bothata bo boholo e ne e le hore ho ne ho se na ho kopana ho hoholo ha li-ISBN. Bona setšoantšo sa Venn se tsoang <a %(blog)s>posong ea rona ea blog</a>:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text5"
msgstr "Re ile ra makala haholo ke hore na ho ne ho na le ho kopana ho fokolang hakae pakeng tsa ISBNdb le Open Library, tseo ka bobeli li kenyelletsang data ka bolokolohi ho tsoa mehloling e fapaneng, joalo ka ho ngola marang-rang le lirekoto tsa laeborari. Haeba ka bobeli ba etsa mosebetsi o motle oa ho fumana li-ISBN tse ngata ka ntle ho moo, mekoloko ea bona e ne e tla ba le ho kopana ho hoholo, kapa e 'ngoe e tla ba karolo ea e 'ngoe. E ile ea re etsa hore re ipotse, ke libuka tse kae tse oelang <em>ka ntle ho mekoloko ee</em>? Re hloka database e kholoanyane."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.worldcat"
msgstr "WorldCat"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text6"
msgstr "Ke moo re ileng ra shebana le database e kholo ka ho fetisisa ea libuka lefatšeng: <a %(wikipedia_worldcat)s>WorldCat</a>. Ena ke database e ikemetseng ke mokhatlo o sa etseng phaello <a %(wikipedia_oclc)s>OCLC</a>, o bokellang lirekoto tsa metadata ho tsoa laeboraring hohle lefatšeng, ka ho fapanyetsana ka ho fa laeborari tseo phihlello ea dataset e felletseng, le ho ba bontša liphetho tsa patlo tsa basebelisi ba ho qetela."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text7"
msgstr "Le hoja OCLC e le mokhatlo o sa etseng phaello, mohlala oa bona oa khoebo o hloka ho sireletsa database ea bona. Hantle, re masoabi ho bolela, metsoalle ho OCLC, re fana ka eona kaofela. :-)"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text8"
msgstr "Selemong se fetileng, re ngotse lirekoto tsohle tsa WorldCat ka hloko. Qalong, re ile ra fumana monyetla o motle. WorldCat e ne e sa tsoa qala ho nchafatsa sebaka sa bona sa marang-rang ka botlalo (ka Phato 2022). Sena se ne se kenyelletsa ntlafatso e kholo ea litsamaiso tsa bona tsa backend, e hlahisang mefokolo e mengata ea ts'ireletso. Re ile ra nka monyetla hang-hang, 'me ra khona ho ngola lirekoto tse makholo a limilione (!) ka matsatsi a seng makae."

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.alt.redesign"
msgstr "<em>WorldCat redesign</em>"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text9"
msgstr "Ka mor'a moo, mefokolo ea ts'ireletso e ile ea lokisoa butle-butle ka bonngoe, ho fihlela ea ho qetela eo re e fumaneng e ile ea lokisoa likhoeli tse ka bang khoeli e fetileng. Ka nako eo re ne re se re e-na le lirekoto tsohle, 'me re ne re batla feela lirekoto tsa boleng bo phahameng hanyane. Kahoo re ile ra ikutloa hore ke nako ea ho lokolla!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.text10"
msgstr "A re shebeng lintlha tse ling tsa motheo ka data:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "blog.worldcat-scrape.data.format"
msgstr "<strong>Foromo?</strong> <a %(blog)s>Anna’s Archive Containers (AAC)</a>, e leng <a %(jsonlines)s>JSON Lines</a> e hatelitsoeng ka <a %(zstd)s>Zstandard</a>, hammoho le semantics e hlophisitsoeng. Lik'hontheinara tsena li phuthela mefuta e fapaneng ea lirekoto, ho ipapisitsoe le li-scrapes tse fapaneng tseo re li sebelisitseng."

