#, fuzzy
msgid "page.faq.torrents.a6.li2"
msgstr "2. Re khothaletsa <a %(a_generate)s>ho hlahisa</a> kapa <a %(a_download)s>ho jarolla</a> li-database tsa rona tsa ElasticSearch le MariaDB. Tsena li na le 'mapa bakeng sa rekoto e 'ngoe le e 'ngoe ho Anna’s Archive ho lifaele tsa eona tsa torrent tse tšoanang (haeba li fumaneha), tlas'a \"torrent_paths\" ho ElasticSearch JSON."

